<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5104038003">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Check that the following condition is met in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
DTC P0602, P0604, P062F or P1702 is not detected.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Start engine.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Shift select lever from P to M range.
</ptxt>
</s1>
